duct boundary, source-grounded requirements REQ-01..14 and completion criteria AC-01..15?\\n- Are conflicts C1..C8 and unknowns U1..U5 handled faithfully?\\n- Do the proposed non-material frame dispositions (Design Component, Install) hold?\\n\\n(2) Implementation design\\n- Is it realizable and faithful to the original source and to the conformance asset?\\n- Does it name the correct source surface and the component and UAT verification surfaces?\\n- Does it match the actual CLI bytes?\\n\\n(3) Test design\\n- Does it preserve status 0 and exact stdout \\\"Hello, world!\\\\n\\\"?\\n- Is it accurate about the actual supplied verifiers and their limits (stderr, arguments/stdin, hangs, Node version)?\\n- Do the mechanically identical component and UAT tests satisfy the distinct component-stage and user-outcome-stage meanings? This is an open judgment; decide it explicitly.\\n\\n(4) Execution plan\\n- Does it have command \\\"node\\\"; the exact args; expectedTestPassCount ≥ 2; expectedStdoutMatch containing \\\"fail 0\\\" with no pass count pinned; and assertedReturnValue \\\"Hello, world!\\\"?\\n- Judge the C4 resolution (fixedCommands alongside the top-level command) and the C5 resolution (the newline carried in the stdout expectation).\\n- Confirm that it claims no observed results and does not control execution.\\n\\n(5) Behavior\\n- From b609386b…: CLI exit 0 and exact 14-byte stdout; both test files actually executing the current CLI with at least 2 passes and 0 failures; planSatisfied under the original test_execution_result acceptance rule.\\n- Judge the currentness of sandbox-copy execution tied to the worksite by digest (C7).\\n\\n(6) Revision\\n- Baseline b63cfd1d… on 647697a5… (pass 0, fail 2, exit 1), then a changed registered choice (construction), correction 50dd6daf…, and measurement b609386b… on fe8f4080….\\n- b609386b… lists no producer pointer, so judge the causal link from lineage and digests.\\n- Keep the old failure historical and bound to its original bytes.\\n\\n(7) Complete original\\n- Are all eight required stage meanings in the oracle realized?\\n- Is the test_execution_result meaning supplied by admitted C2 evidence plus this assessment, not by a handwritten receipt?\\n- Were no protected files mutated?\\n\\nThe assessing actor and call must be distinct from the specification, design and construction authors and from the measurement producer. Author reports and self-run checks are not evidence of success.\",\"reason\":\"The prior dependency on design is now satisfied: f60d677d… produced all three remaining assets, and their digests are current in 52b8c819…. Every required evidence role except semantic_assessment now has current admitted support:\\n- realization: the four authored assets and the corrected CLI;\\n- verifier_artifact: the protected tests;\\n- verifier_execution: C2 b609386b… with no stale dependencies;\\n- historical counterevidence: b63cfd1d….\\n\\nThe fulfillment coverage lists assessment_missing as the gap for all seven obligations. No construction, specification or design work is needed before an independent assessment, and nothing newer has made b609386b… stale.\",\"supportRefs\":[\"obligation://default-library-witness/complete-original@5\",\"obligation://default-library-witness/conformance@5\",\"obligation://default-library-witness/implementation-design@5\",\"obligation://default-library-witness/test-design@5\",\"obligation://default-library-witness/execution-plan@5\",\"obligation://default-library-witness/behavior@5\",\"obligation://default-library-witness/revision@5\"],\"evidenceRefs\":[\"task://default-library-witness/s6-original@5\",\"worksite-context-observation://abiogenesis/52b8c8197e8c6924fa70182a278c6b5e78583f95947c2417b48cd9964d4afbc3\",\"result://abiogenesis/b609386b5e8027ffe1e90f95657472fde395a9fdc36c9dcfeccd01825659b470\",\"result://abiogenesis/b63cfd1dc0bc193ebab9987177c88119d945add00bc62eaf4b955388dc513aea\",\"result://abiogenesis/50dd6dafe6c0a3b5ba48e11fa757a465334